<div class="Section1">
<h1>Phase 2: Requirement Analysis Phase</h1>
<p style="font-size: 13pt; color: #4a5568;"><strong>ContentGen (BlogNest) System Requirements</strong></p>

<h2>1. Hardware Requirements</h2>
<table>
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th>Component</th>
      <th>Specification</th>
      <th>Operational Purpose</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>Processor</strong></td>
      <td>Intel Core i5 (8th Gen or above) / AMD Ryzen 5</td>
      <td>Asynchronous Express logic, bcrypt encryption</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>RAM</strong></td>
      <td>8 GB minimum (16 GB recommended)</td>
      <td>Concurrent MongoDB instance, Node runtime, tooling</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>Storage</strong></td>
      <td>1 GB available workspace</td>
      <td>Node dependencies, MongoDB collections and logs</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

<h2>2. Software Requirements</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Operating System:</strong> Windows 10/11, macOS, Linux (cross-platform).</li>
  <li><strong>Node.js:</strong> v16 or above (v18/v20 LTS recommended).</li>
  <li><strong>npm:</strong> v8 or above.</li>
  <li><strong>Express.js:</strong> Routing framework.</li>
  <li><strong>MongoDB:</strong> Document NoSQL engine with Mongoose ODM (v8.9.5).</li>
  <li><strong>Testing:</strong> Postman or Thunder Client extension.</li>
</ul>

<h2>3. User Roles &amp; Responsibilities</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Admin:</strong> Complete environment override, user role management, account status toggling, system metrics.</li>
  <li><strong>Editor:</strong> Reviews pending drafts, transitions statuses to published, curates categories, moderates comments.</li>
  <li><strong>Author:</strong> Creates blog posts, uploads media pathways, organizes drafts, reviews personal analytics.</li>
  <li><strong>Reader:</strong> Public consumer. Queries published posts, toggles likes, submits comments.</li>
</ul>

<h2>4. Functional Requirements (FRs)</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>FR-1:</strong> User authentication with JWT and bcrypt password hashing.</li>
  <li><strong>FR-2:</strong> Blog lifecycle management (Draft, Pending Approval, Scheduled, Published).</li>
  <li><strong>FR-3:</strong> Compound text search across title, message, category, and tags.</li>
  <li><strong>FR-4:</strong> Automated blog synthesis via Google Gemini AI (/api/ai/generate-blog).</li>
  <li><strong>FR-5:</strong> Real-time semantic compression abstract engine (/api/ai/summarize).</li>
  <li><strong>FR-6:</strong> AI specialized helpers: FAQs, WeatherWise, FitTrack.</li>
  <li><strong>FR-7:</strong> Comment moderation workflow (approved, pending, spam).</li>
  <li><strong>FR-8:</strong> Media pathway asset registration.</li>
</ul>
</div>
</body>
